From 37e04e37e9ae512ae9919ac9f410e38de689e5a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 19:09:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] mips: airoha: add tpl+spl build for en7528 and move
 print_cpuinfo to cpu.c

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
